name DATA:84BD td_lights
comment DATA:84BD the lists of td_* end with a negative word (FFFFh); the records they reach are described at their users: lamps and light groups (update_lights, blink_lights), groups, targets and hit rectangles (test_hit_rects), lanes (test_lanes_a), holes (map_event_run), locks (reset_locks), event objects (run_events), sequences (run_event), messages (message_step)
name DATA:84BF td_rotating
comment DATA:84BF light groups whose lit bits move one lamp along when a flipper is pressed (rotate_lights)
name DATA:84C1 td_extra_ball
name DATA:84C3 td_ign_timers
comment DATA:84C3 records: +0 frames left, +2 the period, +4 a light group, +6 a sequence, +8 sound (high byte) and jingle; each period the last lit lamp of the group goes out (with the sound) and the sequence's step goes back by one (ign_timers)
name DATA:84C5 td_chains
comment DATA:84C5 light groups lit in order: the first lamp not lit for the player blinks (flag 40h), the ones after it are cleared (light_chains)
name DATA:84C7 td_random_lights
comment DATA:84C7 targets; one of them (by frame_count) gets its lamp blinking (flag 2); hitting that one runs the event of td_random_event's group (pick_random_light, random_light_check)
name DATA:84C9 td_random_event
name DATA:84CB td_locks
comment DATA:84CB records of 6 bytes: +0 the hole, +2 its lamp (flags 14h: blinks when lit, while the locks are lit), +4 FFFFh while a ball is in it
name DATA:84CD td_objects
name DATA:84CF td_timed
comment DATA:84CF event objects with a timer (+24h, +26h; object_timers)
name DATA:84D1 td_events
comment DATA:84D1 the sequences whose steps go back to 0 at a new ball (unless their byte +1 is set) and a new game (reset_objects)
name DATA:84D3 td_count_obj
comment DATA:84D3 the event object whose hits are counted at player record +14h (BCD) and +16h; at count_target the sequence of td_count_event's group (+2) runs and the count starts again (count_object)
name DATA:845D count_target
comment DATA:845D hits of td_count_obj for its event: 9 Ignition, 4 Steel Wheel, 1 the others
name DATA:84D5 td_count_event
name DATA:84D7 td_count_obj2
comment DATA:84D7 the event object whose hits are counted at player record +10h (BCD; Ignition shows it) and +12h
name DATA:84D9 td_count_texts
