comment DATA:89C9 FFh while no game runs: lamps with flag 4 blink as well, blinking in every group (blink_lights, update_lights)
name DATA:89C6 booster_col
comment DATA:89C6 where count_boosters writes the boosters into td_txt_boosters
name DATA:979A lock2_used
comment DATA:979A set by lock_ball2 (lock3_used by lock_ball3), cleared by new_game, read nowhere
name DATA:979C lock3_used
name DATA:8D99 lights
comment DATA:8D99 light_count records of 26h bytes (the layout of ball_obj): +22h the palette slot (0..), set by init_lights; a lamp's +4 points at one
comment DATA:8ACA an object whose handler runs every frame until it returns ZF set
name DATA:8A9E ball_locked
name DATA:8A9F locks_lit
name DATA:89D2 light_count
name DATA:89D4 lights_off_pal
name DATA:89D6 lights_on_pal
