comment DATA:89D8 3 bytes a light: the colours uploaded to DAC 40h.. every tick (upload_lights); a light is on or off by its colours
name DATA:8CFB table_palette
name CODE:301E test_hit_rects
comment CODE:301E hit_x/hit_y against the hit rectangles, then the targets of the rectangle's group: the first target hit and not yet hit by the player gives hit_object and hit_score (the group), and the group's sounds
comment CODE:301E a hit rectangle: 0Ah bytes, x1, y1, x2, y2 (inclusive), the group
comment CODE:301E a group: 16h bytes, +0 its first member (target or lamp), +2 sound (high byte) and jingle (FFh: none), +4 points (BCD, 8 bytes) to the score, +0Ch points to the bonus, +14h a sequence (run_object_event); light groups go on: +16h frames to the next blink, +17h the blink period, +18h the chase phase (blink_lights)
comment CODE:301E a target: 0Eh bytes, +0 type (1, 8: lit by a hit, mark_hit_object; 4: nothing; 7: a hit then ignored for 14h frames, the count at +0Eh), +1 the players who hit it (a bit each), +2 the lamp lit by a hit (light_hit_object), +4 the next target of the group, +6 x1, +8 y1, +0Ah x2, +0Ch y2 (inclusive)
name CODE:30E1 test_lanes_a
comment CODE:30E1 hit_x/hit_y in a lane (0Ah bytes: x1, y1, x2, y2 (x2, y2 not inside), an object): hit_object = the object, hit_score = its group (+4), hit_lane set, sound 2 (lanes_b: 6); not when tilted
comment CODE:30E1 the lanes' and holes' objects: +0 type, +1 busy/hit bits, +2 a lamp, +4 the group (score, sounds, sequence)
name CODE:30D9 test_lanes_b
name CODE:312D light_hit_object
name CODE:3148 mark_hit_object
name CODE:3180 add_hit_score
comment CODE:3180 the score record's points (+4) to the score, (+0Ch) to the bonus; repeated for a while when a spinner-like object set 8A90h
name CODE:31D2 map_event_run
comment CODE:31D2 AL = the map's event number: its hole from map_events: the group's sounds; unless busy (+1): type 6 (a lock: held when the locks are lit), type 5 (the ball held while the group's points are given +8 times, every +6 frames: add_hit_score), both then put the ball at +0Eh, +10h (pixels) with the speed +0Ah, +0Ch and run the group's sequence; type 14h runs the group's sequence; any other just gives hit_object and hit_score; the other holes' busy bytes are cleared
name CODE:3373 run_events
comment CODE:3373 pops the event stack, an entry (0 or FFFFh, an event object) a call; while running_object is set its handler runs instead
comment CODE:3373 FFFFh (armed): sound +1Ch, lamp +1Eh lit (unless +1 = FEh), message +20h (priority +3), flag 4: the timer restarts
comment CODE:3373 0 (fired): points +6 to the score and +0Eh to the bonus (BCD, 8 bytes each), sound +4, count_object, lamp +18h lit, lamp +1Eh out, flag 1: the handler +16h runs every frame until it returns ZF (running_object), flag 2: the timer restarts, the handler +16h, message +1Ah (priority +2)
comment CODE:3373 an event object: 2Ah bytes, +0 type (1Eh: fires only when armed for the player, then disarmed unless +1 = FEh; 1Fh: always), +22h the players it is armed for, +23h flags, +24h the timer's period, +26h the timer (object_timers: at 0 disarmed and lamp +1Eh out); objects with the handler advance_object have 2Eh bytes (+28h, +2Ah, +2Ch)
name CODE:39FC run_object_event
comment CODE:39FC SI = a group: its sequence (+14h), if any
name CODE:3A13 run_event
comment CODE:3A13 DI = a sequence: pushes event objects to the event stack; a word of it: an event object, +8000h: arm it (FFFFh on the stack), +4000h: run that sequence instead
comment CODE:3A13 type 2Ah (a word): the words from +2 up to FFFFh, all of them; types 28h, 29h: +2..+9 the step of each player, the step's word at +0Ah + 2 * step: FFFFh nothing, FFFEh step 0 again, FFFDh one step back, FFFCh the step := the next word; type 28h moves one step on after each (back again when an object of type 1Eh is not armed), 29h only by advance_object
name CODE:422A score_object
comment CODE:422A the object's points: +6 to the score, +0Eh to the bonus
name CODE:3497 set_message
name CODE:34AE restart_timer
name CODE:34B5 count_object
name CODE:351A blink_lights
comment CODE:351A each light group every +17h frames: lamps with flag 40h change their blink phase, with 20h the group's chase moves a lamp on
name CODE:357C update_lights
comment CODE:357C the current player's lamps into the palette, at most ten changes a frame; player record +18h.. keeps what each lamp shows
comment CODE:357C a lamp: 8 bytes, +0 flags, +1 lit, a bit per player, +2 the blink phase, +3 the state shown with flag 2, +4 the light (palette slot), +6 the next lamp of the group
comment CODE:357C flags: 2 shows +3 (random_light_check, blink_light_group), 4 blinks (unlit; lit too with 10h), 8 not counted by light_group_done, 10h lit means blinking, 20h a chase in the group, 40h blinks, 80h kept at a new ball (lights_off_player)
name CODE:3613 idle_update_lights
name CODE:41A6 light_on
comment CODE:41A6 SI = a light: its palette slot gets the "on" colours
name CODE:41D7 light_off
name CODE:4208 upload_lights
comment CODE:4208 light_palette to the DAC from colour 40h; the frame callback once the game runs
name CODE:3666 ign_timers
comment CODE:3666 Ignition only: timed lights (td_ign_timers)
name CODE:3710 light_chains
name CODE:3754 rect_group_done
comment CODE:3754 all objects of a hit rectangle group lit: its event, then they go out one by one (clear_rect_group)
name CODE:3797 light_group_done
name CODE:37F3 clear_rect_group
name CODE:381F blink_light_group
