comment CODE:386E a flipper was pressed: the lit states of each group of td_rotating move by one (lane change)
name CODE:38A9 object_timers7
name CODE:38D9 hold_ball_check
name CODE:2BC7 object_timers
name CODE:2BFF clear_object_timers
name CODE:28D5 reset_locks
comment CODE:28D5 each lock empty, its lamp's flags 14h cleared
name CODE:28F5 lights_off_player
name CODE:2922 lights_off_all
name CODE:2946 reset_objects
name CODE:29A6 reset_objects_all
name CODE:2A41 restore_lights
name CODE:27B9 reset_targets
comment CODE:27B9 the player's bits of every target of both levels' hit rectangles cleared
name CODE:27C8 reset_rect_targets
comment CODE:27C8 DI = hit rectangles: the player's bit of each target of their groups cleared (lights_frame after types 1, 8)
