name CODE:3D81 double_score
name CODE:3D9C double_bonus
name CODE:3DB9 hold_bonus
name CODE:3DBF count_message
comment CODE:3DBF the message of td_count_texts for the count (player record +16h)
name CODE:3DDA collect_jackpot
name CODE:3E11 raise_jackpot
name CODE:3E35 roulette
comment CODE:3E35 "russian roulette": runs through td_roulette slowing down, lighting each; the last one's event (the start from td_roulette_pick by the frame counter)
name CODE:3F17 countdown
name CODE:40FA light_locks
comment CODE:40FA unless a ball is locked: locks_lit, each lock's lamp lit and blinking (flags 14h)
name CODE:412D lock_ball
comment CODE:412D locks lit: the ball is held, a new one comes (state 4); the two after it the same with 9789h/978Bh set
name CODE:4150 lock_ball2
name CODE:4179 lock_ball3
; ---- sound (INT 66h driver)
; (not mapped) name CODE:4F50 load_sound_driver
; (not mapped) comment CODE:4F50 drive C:, \DELUXE, SOUND.CFG names the driver, EXEC of it, back to the drive it came from
name CODE:50BC start_music
comment CODE:50BC the table's module (LEVELn.MOD) loaded by the driver, the callbacks timer_callback and module_callback set
name CODE:5157 stop_sound
name CODE:5177 module_callback
; (not mapped) name CODE:5201 timer_callback
; (not mapped) comment CODE:5201 each tick of the driver's timer: the sprites (sprites_in_irq), the frame callback, the music and sound requests, timer_tick
name CODE:52A8 music_volume_step
comment CODE:52A8 not called
name CODE:52C5 play_tune
name CODE:52EE music_fade
name CODE:536E tune_request_run
name CODE:53C0 jingle_request_run
name CODE:545D sound_request_run
name DATA:83BE sound_on
name DATA:83BF timer_tick
name DATA:8464 tune_request
comment DATA:8464 FFh none, 80h fade out, else a position of the module's main tune (presumably)
name DATA:8465 sound_request
comment DATA:8465 a sound effect: FFh none, else an entry of the table's effect list (4 bytes, INT 66h AL=11h)
name DATA:8466 jingle_request
comment DATA:8466 a short tune: FFh none, else an entry of the table's jingle list (a module position)
name DATA:846A sprites_in_irq
name DATA:846B frame_callback
comment DATA:846B called every tick: nothing (4BE4h) until the game runs, then upload_lights
name CODE:4B77 no_callback
name DATA:845F music_fade_dir
; ---- options (C:\DELUXE\DDPCOPTN.BIN, written by the menu)
name DATA:9AA7 opt_balls
comment DATA:9AA7 the options, DDPCOPTN.BIN as it is (defaults in load_options): 1 = 3 balls a game (checked), else 5
name DATA:9AA8 opt_music
comment DATA:9AA8 1: the music follows the game (tunes and jingles), else presumably one tune
name DATA:9AA9 opt_palette
comment DATA:9AA9 1: grey palettes
name DATA:9AAA opt_slope
comment DATA:9AAA gravity = 9 + 2 * (opt_slope - 1) (presumably the table's slope)
name DATA:9AAB key_lflipper
comment DATA:9AAB the keys, as byte index and mask of key_map: LShift, RShift, Space, E0 Down (checked)
name DATA:9AAD key_rflipper
name DATA:9AAF key_nudge
name DATA:9AB1 key_plunger
name DATA:9AB3 opt_screen
comment DATA:9AB3 1: 320x200, 2: 320x350, the table scrolls less (checked with a DDPCOPTN.BIN of these 14 bytes)
name DATA:846F options_file
name DATA:80EF hiscore_file
